{"id":"n26771-1-9","stage":2,"title":"윗사람 · 长辈","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26771-1-9-1","ko":"명절 때 뭐할 거니?","zh":"节日的时候你打算做什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"명절","meaning":"节日","explanation":"명절：节日。","readings":[{"term":"명절","audio":"/audio/7626dbdf4beacffb4c81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55441","senseId":"1","lemma":"명절","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"명절","audio":"/audio/7626dbdf4beacffb4c81.mp3"}},{"text":"때","meaning":"时候","explanation":"때：时候。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"5","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐할","meaning":"什么；做，干","explanation":"뭐：什么；하다：做，干；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"},{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐할","audio":"/audio/71358febdbae7d6770b8.mp3"}},{"text":"거니?","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거니","audio":"/audio/3e0100c9477501692d3f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7626dbdf4beacffb","term":"명절","zh":"节日","audio":"/audio/7626dbdf4beacffb4c81.mp3","entryId":"55441","definition":"春节、中秋等每年固定的传统庆祝日或纪念日。","pronunciation":["명절"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"在某种状况下。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么